{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type FieldGroupFieldSlotMode = \"strict\" | \"loose\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FieldGroup/fieldGroupTypes.public.ts#L12","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FieldGroup/fieldGroupTypes.public.ts:12"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Controls how a virtual field's value type is matched to concrete form field\npaths."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"strict"},{"type":"text","value":" requires an exact type match. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"loose"},{"type":"text","value":" also accepts narrower value\ntypes that are assignable to the virtual field's declared type."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype FieldGroupFieldSlotMode = \"strict\" | \"loose\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [FieldGroup/fieldGroupTypes.public.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FieldGroup/fieldGroupTypes.public.ts#L12)\n\nControls how a virtual field's value type is matched to concrete form field\npaths.\n\n`strict` requires an exact type match. `loose` also accepts narrower value\ntypes that are assignable to the virtual field's declared type.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FieldGroupFieldSlotMode\ntitle: FieldGroupFieldSlotMode\n---\n\n```ts\ntype FieldGroupFieldSlotMode = \"strict\" | \"loose\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [FieldGroup/fieldGroupTypes.public.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FieldGroup/fieldGroupTypes.public.ts#L12)\n\nControls how a virtual field's value type is matched to concrete form field\npaths.\n\n`strict` requires an exact type match. `loose` also accepts narrower value\ntypes that are assignable to the virtual field's declared type.\n"}
